+---
+name: Sensitive pay or privacy problem
+about: Report a reproduction without attaching worker records
+title: "[Safety] "
+labels: ''
+assignees: ''
+---
+
+**Do not attach a paystub or complete backup. Do not post government identifiers, bank details,
+employer credentials, coworkers' data or confidential operational information. Use synthetic examples.**
+
+App version/build:
+Screen and action:
+Expected behavior (synthetic values):
+Observed behavior (synthetic values):
+Steps to reproduce:
+Did saved records remain available? (yes/no/unknown)
+
+Keep your original records safe until the problem is understood. Support cannot retrieve records
+that remain on your device. This issue is not legal representation or a filing/grievance submission.
+The support owner must arrange any strictly necessary sensitive exchange through an approved
+minimal-data process before requesting it. Do not paste private counsel advice here.
